{
  "id": "6ab74adab54d0befa8307b69",
  "title": "reStructuredText",
  "created": 1790397178,
  "updated": 1790402570,
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "6ab74adab54d0befa8307b69",
      "text": "reStructuredText",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397178,
      "updated": 1790397178
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab75f4100000000007302fc",
      "text": " .[rst]",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1790402370,
      "updated": 1790402391
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e125b",
      "text": "\treStructuredTextは、主に[技術文書]に使用するための軽量[マークアップ言語]して設計されている",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790402570
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e125c",
      "text": "\t\tPythonコミュニティの公式ドキュメント",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e125d",
      "text": "\t\t[kernel.org]の[https://docs.kernel.org/ ドキュメント]",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e125e",
      "text": "\t\tCMake、LLVM コンパイラプロジェクト ",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e125f",
      "text": "\t\tGitHubはReStructuredText形式(`.rst`)をプレビューできる",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790398281
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74f1c00000000000e1288",
      "text": "\t\t\t[https://github.com/torvalds/linux/blob/master/Documentation/process/researcher-guidelines.rst linux/Documentation/process/researcher-guidelines.rst]",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790398236,
      "updated": 1790398260
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e1260",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e1261",
      "text": "\t[Python] の Doc-SIG が進める [Docutils] プロジェクトの一部である",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790402539
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e1262",
      "text": " \tDocutils は Python プログラムからコメントや情報を抽出し、それらをさまざまな形式のプログラムドキュメントへ変換するためのもの。",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e1263",
      "text": " \treStructuredTextの代表的なパーサはPythonで実装されている",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e1264",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e1265",
      "text": "特徴",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e1266",
      "text": "\tMarkdown と似た役割を果たすが、文書構造を豊かに表現することができる。",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e1267",
      "text": "\tDocutils のような文書処理ソフトウェアによって容易に処理できるように設計されている。",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e1268",
      "text": "\t[Sphinx]を介することで、同一のrstファイルからHTMLやPDF、EPUBなど複数の形式で文書ファイルを生成できる。",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397931
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e1269",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e126a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e126b",
      "text": "歴史",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e126c",
      "text": "\treStructuredText は、[Zope] で開発された軽量マークアップ言語 [StructuredText] を基に発展",
      "userId": "6780c5dd585ee07f1dc50b2b",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790402515
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e126d",
      "text": "\t\treStructuredTextという名前は「StructuredText を改訂（revised）し、再構築（reworked）し、再解釈（reinterpreted）したもの」であることを示すために選ばれた。",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e126e",
      "text": "\t2001年\t最初のリリース。",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e126f",
      "text": "\t2002年〜\tPython コミュニティにおいて広く利用されるようになった",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e1270",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e1271",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e1272",
      "text": "具体例",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e1273",
      "text": " code: python",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e1274",
      "text": " \t.. code:: python",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e1275",
      "text": " \t    print(\"Hello, World!\")",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74cd400000000000e1284",
      "text": "\tPython ソースコードを読み書きするプログラマにとっても読みやすい形式となっている。",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397652,
      "updated": 1790397657
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74cda00000000000e1285",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397658,
      "updated": 1790397658
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b6000000000000e127d",
      "text": " code: rst",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397280,
      "updated": 1790397700
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e1277",
      "text": "  Sub-heading",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e1278",
      "text": "  -----------",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e1279",
      "text": "  ",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e127a",
      "text": "  **strong emphasis**, ``monospace``",
      "userId": "62fd0bb61ddb37001d282fdf",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790397186
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab74b0200000000000e127c",
      "text": "\t[reST] の構文の一部は、 [Setext] 言語から着想を得ている。",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1790397186,
      "updated": 1790402342
    },
    {
      "id": "6ab75f2600000000003b8081",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5b5e7121417cf700145b98c2",
      "created": 1790402342,
      "updated": 1790402342
    }
  ]
}